				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="ITEMINFO_293"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もたせると　すばやさが　さがるが
ふつうよりも　ポケモンの　すばやさが
たかく　そだちやすい。</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>持たせると　素早さが　さがるが
ふつうよりも　ポケモンの　素早さが
高く　育ちやすい。</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
